# Files that scripts compare byte for byte (notebook staleness, experiment bundles, data
# fixtures and figures). Their committed form is LF. On Windows with core.autocrlf=true a
# checkout would write CRLF, which changes the bytes and makes those checks fail. eol=lf
# keeps the working copy identical to the committed bytes on every platform.
website/notebooks/*.json text eol=lf
website/assets/experiments/*.json text eol=lf
docs/experiment-bundle-determinism.json text eol=lf
examples/data/**/*.csv text eol=lf
examples/data/**/*.svg text eol=lf
